  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu NIU Trade Capacity Strengthening Project _</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The INFA EIF Funded (US60k) project continues to work towards strengthening Tuvalu&#x2019;s trade capacity, with its funding directed towards key strategic actions around: building a more sustainable National Implementation Unit (NIU) for Tuvalu DOT and improving NIU functions, additional resources management with an enhanced NIU Finance unit. The objective is to build NIU/DOT units&#x2019; skills and knowledge on the broad Ministry&#x2019;s financial reporting including EIF and other projects financial report as well as other fiduciary matters. These capacity building workshops/training will focus on helping the team to also fulfil the EIF project closure financial and fiduciary related requirements in a most effective and timely manner.</narrative>
  </description>
